Description:
 sophomorix-belwue-mail - Reading external Mail data at Belwue and suggest actions
 sophomorix-developer - Test suite for sophomorix-samba
 sophomorix-dump - Migration dump script
 sophomorix-samba - Sophomorix for Samba 4
 sophomorix-vampire - Migration vampire script
Changes:
 sophomorix4 (1:7.4.7~edu) lmn74; urgency=medium
 .
   * edulution fork. The packages keep their upstream names, so the epoch 1:
     is what makes them win against the same packages from
     deb.linuxmuster.net.
   * The version carries the suffix ~edu on top of the epoch, so apt policy,
     dpkg -l and the motd show at a glance that this is the edulution build
     and not the upstream package. "~" sorts before the empty string, so
     1:7.4.7~edu stays below a hypothetical 1:7.4.7 while still outranking
     every upstream 7.x, which carries no epoch at all. The versioned
     dependencies on the fork's own packages therefore clamp on "(>=
     1:x.y.z~)", the Debian idiom that also accepts a tilde suffix.
   * The internal clamps of sophomorix-developer, -vampire and -belwue-mail
     move from sophomorix-samba (>=3.92.1) to (>= 1:7.4.7~). The old clamp was
     stale and would have been satisfied by the upstream package, which is
     exactly the mixing the epoch is there to prevent.
   * The github-release job asks for contents: write. The repository's
     default GITHUB_TOKEN permission is read, so creating the release would
     have failed with a 403 on the first tag. Granting it on the job keeps
     the default untouched for every other workflow.
   * Release workflow publishes to edulution-io/edulution-package-server
     instead of linuxmuster/deb, into the Ubuntu codename resolute.
   * read_ui() skips the webui permissions when
     /usr/lib/linuxmuster-webui/etc/default-ui-permissions.ini is missing,
     instead of exiting. The file was generated by linuxmuster-webui7, which
     this fork does not install, and the exit (with code 0) turned every
     sophomorix command into a silent no-op: linuxmuster-setup could not
     create global-admin. sophomorixWebuiPermissionsCalculated now stays
     empty; nothing in the edulution stack reads it.
